.vscode

# Reassembled at boot from assets/video-chunks/ by ChunkedAsset. 183 MB, and
# larger than GitHub's per-file limit -- it must never be committed. The
# .tmp sibling is where ChunkedAsset#write_atomically writes before the
# atomic rename; a crash or Ctrl-C mid-assembly can leave up to the same
# 183 MB behind under that name, so it needs the same treatment.
/public/img/videos/0-rob-d.mp4
/public/img/videos/0-rob-d.mp4.tmp
